        "custom_title": "41100-solo-pil-standard",
        "intro_highlight": "Engineered at the exact intersection of practitioner ergonomics and rigorous North American manufacturing standards, the Solo-Pil Standard streamlines high-volume depilatory workflows. This purpose-built unit delivers instant thermal stability, allowing practicing specialists to maintain absolute focus on treatment execution rather than equipment monitoring.",
        "custom_description": "<p>The Solo-Pil Standard is purpose-built for licensed professionals, including Estheticians, Medical Spa Therapists, and Lash Technicians. Its precision-engineered thermal regulation targets visual fatigue and wrist discomfort during back-to-back appointments, enabling sharper focus on technical precision and enhanced client comfort. Whether you are performing brow sculpting, deep-pore cleansing prep, or full-body hair removal, this professional station adjusts to your modality-specific positioning with instant-response calibration and intuitive one-hand control.</p>",
        "subtitle": "Professional Grade Reliability",
        "secondary_description": "<p>Heavy-duty reliability is central to the Equipro approach. To preserve the rapid heating efficiency and thermal calibration of the Solo-Pil Standard, daily wipe-downs with a professional citrus-based solvent formulated for clinical spa environments are recommended. The internal heating chamber resists heavy chemical accumulation, ensuring flawless operational consistency across years of high-volume use. Consistent care guarantees repeatable results and reduced downtime.</p>",
        "show_variant_selectors": true,
