          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Estheticians:",
            "answer": "<p>Experienced Estheticians managing back-to-back appointments rely on the rapid heating element of the Solo-Pil Standard to eliminate client wait times. By maintaining a constant, predictable temperature profile throughout full 8-hour shifts, the system prevents the wax from thickening or overheating, allowing for seamless, fluid application during delicate facial hair removal and brow sculpting.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_74hYTC": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Clinical Spa Technicians:",
            "answer": "<p>For Clinical Spa Technicians integrating depilatory services into broader aesthetic treatment plans, space-saving ergonomics are paramount. The compact footprint ($8.25\" \\times 7\" \\times 5\"H$) fits seamlessly onto auxiliary treatment trolleys without disrupting clean field protocols. The stable, insulated chassis ensures safe operation even when positioned in close proximity to advanced laser systems and facial treatment towers.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_bhzmwM": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Waxing Specialists:",
            "answer": "<p>High-volume Waxing Specialists benefit directly from the universal 3 5/8-inch chamber compatibility. This standardized diameter allows technicians to rapidly swap direct-insert depilatory tins without needing specialized adapters, drastically reducing turnaround times between clients and ensuring strict adherence to clinic sanitation standards.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
